        "\n",
        "## N-component gaussian mixture model {#sec-BNP-n-component-gaussian-mixture-model}\n",
        "\n",
        "we now move to the case where we have K components in our mixture model\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "### Generative story for K components {#sec-BNP-generative-story-k-components}\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "![generating cluster weights](/images/c6/C6-SL12a.png){.column-margin}\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "summarizes the generative story as follows:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. we draw the weights $\\rho_{1:k}, $ for the each cluster from a **Dirichlet distribution** with parameters $\\alpha_{0:K}$. \n",
        "2. we generate the means $\\mu_1, \\mu_2$ for the two clusters from a normal distribution with mean $\\mu_0$ and variance $\\sigma_0^2$.\n",
        "3. we generate the points $x_n$ from a normal distribution with mean $\\mu_{z_n}$ and covariance $\\Sigma$ where $z_n$ is the cluster assignment for point $n$.\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "![generating cluster means](/images/c6/C6-SL12b.png){.column-margin}\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "#### The Hierarchical Model for the Generative Story:\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\\begin{aligned}\n",
        "\\rho_{1:K} & \\sim \\text{Dirichlet}(\\alpha_{1:k}) && \\text{cluster weights} \\\\\n",
        "\\mu_k & \\stackrel{iid}{\\sim} \\mathcal{N}(\\mu_0, \\sigma_0^2), \\quad k=1,2 && \\text{cluster means} \\\\\n",
        "z_n & \\stackrel{iid}{\\sim} \\text{Categorical}(\\rho_{1:k} &&  \\text{point cluster assignments} \\\\\n",
        "x_n & \\stackrel{indep}{\\sim} \\mathcal{N}(\\mu_0, \\Sigma) && \\text{point generation} \\\\\n",
        "\\end{aligned}\n",
        "$$ {#eq-bnp-gaussian-mixture-model}\n",
        "\n",
